# Archetype Definitions
Fortune-Teller	KEY:Fortune-Teller (Bard)	CATEGORY:Archetype	TYPE:Archetype.BardArchetype	PRECLASS:1,Bard=1	DESC:Instead of using song and dance, a fortune-teller influences people by divining their fate.	COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.32
Hellcat	KEY:Hellcat (Monk)	CATEGORY:Archetype	TYPE:Archetype.MonkArchetype	PRECLASS:1,Monk=1	PREALIGN:LE,LN	DESC:Monks of the hellcat sect follow the teachings of Asmodeus or another infernal power.	COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Hunting Serpent	KEY:Hunting Serpent (Ninja)	CATEGORY:Archetype	TYPE:Archetype.NinjaArchetype	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=1	DESC:The order dispatches specially trained killers to hunt relentlessly and fight from the shadows.	COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.105

# Fortune-Teller (Bard) Features
Fortune-Teller's Divinations	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.BardClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Bard=1	DESC:Add guidance, object reading, augury, analyze aura, divination, retrocognition, true seeing, and vision to your bard spell list.
Oracular Performance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.BardClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Bard=1	DESC:You can use Perform (oratory) to read a fortune as part of a bardic performance.
Fortune-Teller's Acumen	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.BardClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Bard=2	DESC:Use a fortune-teller's deck instead of a material component for divination spells.
Transparent Fate	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.BardClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Bard=8	DESC:Cause all enemies within 30 feet to have their near future revealed.

# Hellcat (Monk) Features
Hellcat Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.MonkClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Monk=1	DESC:Proficient with club, crossbow, dagger, kama, light mace, nunchaku, quarterstaff, sai, shuriken, and siangham.
Hellcat Fury	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.MonkClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Monk=1	DESC:Deal slashing damage with unarmed strikes, causing bleed on critical hits.
Torture Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.MonkClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Monk=2	DESC:Attempt a second save against fatigue, exhaustion, sickness, stagger, or fear effects.
Crucible of Pain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.MonkClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Monk=3	DESC:Gain DR/- against nonlethal damage equal to half your monk level.
Hellcat Ki	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.MonkClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Monk=4	DESC:Spend ki to gain darkvision, scent, fire resistance, or ghostly flame silhouettes.

# Hunting Serpent (Ninja) Features
Relentless Pursuit	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.NinjaClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=3	DESC:Gain a bonus on Diplomacy to gather information and Survival to follow tracks.
Death Mark	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.NinjaClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=4	DESC:Mark an opponent damaged by sneak attack for death, gaining bonuses against them.
Certain Demise	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.NinjaClassFeature	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=10	DESC:Apply sneak attack damage on the first attack against the target of your death mark.

# Cavalier Order
Order of the Whip	KEY:Order of the Whip (Cavalier)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.CavalierOrder	PRECLASS:1,Cavalier=1	DESC:Pledged to cruelty and malice, serving only those who grant free rein to cause suffering.	SOURCEPAGE:p.20
Whip Crack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.CavalierOrder	PRECLASS:1,Cavalier=2	DESC:You become proficient with a whip and gain Whip Mastery as a bonus feat.
Fearless Commander	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.CavalierOrder	PRECLASS:1,Cavalier=8	DESC:Inspire terror among your allies, granting them bonuses by dealing nonlethal damage.
Retribution	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.CavalierOrder	PRECLASS:1,Cavalier=15	DESC:Gain attacks of opportunity against those who strike your slaves or servants.

# Oracle Mystery & Curse
Ascetic	KEY:Ascetic (Oracle Mystery)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleMystery	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:You practice martial disciplines and internal focus.	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Absence of Body	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:You require half as much food and water to survive.
Absence of Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:You gain feather fall as a spell-like ability.
Ascetic Armor	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:Gain a +4 armor bonus to AC when unarmored.
Martial Disciple	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:Gain Improved Unarmed Strike and the unarmed strike damage of a monk.
Oracular Spellstrike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=7	DESC:Deliver spells through unarmed strikes.
Rapid Convalescence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:Reduce consecutive successful saves needed to recover from disease or poison.
Spell Deflection	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleRevelation	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=11	DESC:Counterspell ray attacks with unarmed strikes.
Toxic Blood	KEY:Toxic Blood (Oracle Curse)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.ClassFeature.OracleCurse	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=1	DESC:Your body is ravaged by a potent poison, making your touch venomous.	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
